{"speciesId":634,"names":{"fr":"Diamat","es":"Zweilous","en":"Zweilous","ja":"ジヘッド"},"descriptions":[{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Quand il a mangé tout ce qui traînait sur son territoire, il migre vers d’autres horizons. Ses 2 têtes s’entendent mal."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"After it has eaten up all the food in its territory, it moves to another area. Its two heads do not get along."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Ses deux têtes s’entendent mal. Même en mangeant, elles se cherchent des noises et dévorent à qui mieux mieux."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Since their two heads do not get along and compete with each other for food, they always eat too much."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The two heads do not get along. Whichever head eats more than the other gets to be the leader."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The two heads do not get along. Whichever head eats more than the other gets to be the leader."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Ses deux têtes s’entendent mal et sont en compétition permanente pour savoir qui mangera le plus et qui sera le chef."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Sus dos cabezas se llevan fatal, y la que consigue comer más que la otra es la que lleva la voz cantante."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"The two heads do not get along. Whichever head eats more than the other gets to be the leader."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"２つの 頭は 仲が 悪く 相手より 多く 食べることで 主導権を 握ろうと する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"Quand il a mangé tout ce qui traînait sur son territoire, il migre vers d’autres horizons. Ses 2 têtes s’entendent mal."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Cambia de morada siempre que termina con la comida de una zona. Sus dos cabezas se llevan fatal."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"After it has eaten up all the food in its territory, it moves to another area. Its two heads do not get along."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"縄張りの エサを 食べつくすと ほかの 土地へ 移動する。 ２つの 頭は 仲が 悪い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Ses deux têtes s’entendent mal et sont en compétition permanente pour savoir qui mangera le plus et qui sera le chef."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Sus dos cabezas se llevan fatal, y la que consigue comer más que la otra es la que lleva la voz cantante."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"The two heads do not get along. Whichever head eats more than the other gets to be the leader."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"２つの 頭は 仲が 悪く 相手より 多く 食べることで 主導権を 握ろうと する。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Quand il a mangé tout ce qui traînait sur son territoire, il migre vers d’autres horizons. Ses 2 têtes s’entendent mal."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Cambia de morada siempre que termina con la comida de una zona. Sus dos cabezas se llevan fatal."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"After it has eaten up all the food in its territory, it moves to another area. Its two heads do not get along."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"縄張りの エサを 食べつくすと ほかの 土地へ 移動する。 ２つの 頭は 仲が 悪い。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Il cherche des proies en arpentant son territoire. Ses deux têtes se disputent souvent pour savoir quelle direction prendre."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Rastrea su territorio en busca de alimento. A menudo sus dos cabezas son incapaces de acordar hacia qué dirección avanzar."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"While hunting for prey, Zweilous wanders its territory, its two heads often bickering over which way to go."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"縄張りを 歩きまわって エサを 探す。 ２つの 頭は どちらに 進むか よく もめる。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"Ses deux têtes se disputent la même proie. Il est toujours couvert de blessures, même s’il n’a affronté personne."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","tex